      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n2. In Criminal Appeal No.1206/2024, the appellants are the drivers of the vehicle and in Criminal Appeal No.1207/2024, they are the buyers and the sellers of the contraband articles which has been recovered from them, and according to the "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bee50a52691d465e9dd513eec5cc14b3_15",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The vehicle bearing no. K.A. 25 A.A.5198, which was coming from the State of Karnataka had crossed the border, entering the State of Maharashtra in the District of Osmanabad."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aaa98da71e264eb1b01946937d8e2afb_16",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThe vehicle was intercepted and on search, it was found that they were carrying sacks of Sweet Supari (sweetened beetle nut) bearing the brand Tiger."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1dc048875ef042f58315005896f961ff_17",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "An FIR was registered under Sections 26 (2) (i) and (iv), 27 (2) and 23 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 r/w 2.3.4 of the Food Safety and Standards Rules, 2011, and under Sections 30(2), 2, 3, 4, 59 (iv) of Food Adulteration (Maharash"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5658b05b608c4b5293539f0ed3bbed50_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The case of the appellants was that although gutka, pan masala and any variant of tobacco whether scented or in any other form was indeed banned as per the aforesaid circular but sweetened beetle nut was not one of the banned items as per t"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9663bc8941644c269e7186ec3c9431eb_19",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The learned senior counsel for the appellants has taken us to the circular dated 20.07.2018."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "334a6b729fc649a8980765064c315005_20",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The operative portion of the said circular reads as:-\nTherefore I, the Food Safety Commissioner, Maharashtra State, prohibit in the interest of public health, for a period of one year from 201h July 2018, the manufacture, storage, distribut"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8d4f589b2cd14e02b2d2130fdfb0942d_21",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A bare reading of the aforesaid provision/circular shows that what is banned is tobacco which is either flavoured, scented or mixed with any of the additives which may or may not go by the name of gutka, pan masala or any other name whether"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7478e1659dc94d3eaa9840626d3e2337_22",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "What can be easily determined from the above circular is that what is banned is tobacco and its various forms."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "be393f2bf92b4150819bdbf4f25e1e43_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "What was being transported by the appellants was not tobacco but beetle nut which is sweetened."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8e3bbfe180894829a3c1b422b35f28e4_24",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This is not a banned item."
    },
    {
