      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Under these facts, we absolutely see no reason why the appellants should be subjected to criminal proceedings where actually no criminal act was done by the hands of the appellants."
    },
    {
